Third-Party Components and Attribution
================================================================================

1. Google Artemis Accessibility Helper
   Location: packages/artemis-accessibility-helper/ArtemisAccessibilityHelper.apk
   Manifest: packages/artemis-accessibility-helper/helper_manifest.json
   Source:   https://github.com/google/artemis
   License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
   Copyright Google LLC.
   This repository bundles the compiled Artemis Accessibility Helper APK
   (com.artemis.helper v1.2.0) unmodified for local Android UI hierarchy
   inspection and action execution. Its integrity is verified at runtime against
   the SHA-256 digest recorded in helper_manifest.json.

2. Redroid (Remote Android)
   Source:   https://github.com/remote-android/redroid-doc
   License:  Apache License, Version 2.0
   Container base images referenced in docker-compose.yml and
   docker/redroid/Dockerfile are provided by the Remote-Android / Redroid
   project.

3. TypeSafe AI (Optional Cloud Integration)
   Source:   https://typesafe.ai
   The optional `agentdroid ai` subcommand communicates with TypeSafe AI's
   hosted API (`api.typesafe.ai`) when explicitly invoked with a user-supplied
   `TYPESAFE_API_KEY`. It is not required for local MCP, CLI, or compound
   workflow operation.
